  "native": {
    "method": "Native Windows. Same seed, three small changed files plus author walkthrough and one private code edit. Prod is CLI0.9.0; legacy is CLI0.10.9 on a review started with0.9.0; empty is a fresh0.10.9 review without comment documents; notes is a fresh0.10.9 review with Local+Shared saved. One warmup per variant then balanced alternating rounds. Save is guarded on current CLI and returns human output in every variant. Three fresh primary reports measured separately. Continue is timed separately, without IDE. Setup, guard capture and assertions excluded. Trace2 enabled equally. No own IDE or test suite runs during measurement. This isolates session/content cost within current engine, not every historical change that shipped with Comments.",
